-- ============================================================
-- Warrior (Protection): Mocking Blow
-- ============================================================
-- TODO.md: "Mocking Blow: Now deals 100% weapon damage by default, and is
--           only usable in Defensive Stance."
--
-- Two problems with the stock spell, and "by default" is aimed at both.
--
-- 1. Only rank 1 (694) deals weapon damage at all.  It uses
--    SPELL_EFFECT_NORMALIZED_WEAPON_DMG (121) with base points 0, i.e. a plain
--    100% weapon swing.  Ranks 2-7 were rewritten by Blizzard as
--    SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE (2) with a flat number -- 47504 deals a fixed
--    330 -- which stopped scaling with the weapon the moment it was written.
--    Every rank now carries rank 1's effect, so the ability is a weapon strike
--    at every level.
--
-- 2. Even rank 1 only dealt that damage against a tauntable target.  The
--    "If the target is tauntable" clause in the old description is
--    spell_warr_mocking_blow (src/server/scripts/Spells/spell_warrior.cpp:90),
--    which zeroes the damage when the victim is immune to EFFECT_1's taunt.
--    Players are permanently taunt-immune (PlayerStorage.cpp:5686) and so are
--    boss-flagged creatures (Creature.cpp:683), so against exactly the targets
--    a Protection warrior fights, the "damage" half was already dead -- and
--    Incite, which multiplies that damage, would have been dead with it.
--    The registration is deleted below rather than the core file edited.
--
-- Stances.  This is a bitmask of 1 << (form - 1), and the warrior stances are
-- forms 0x11/0x12/0x13 (UnitDefines.h:89-91), NOT 1/2/3:
--     Battle    (17) = 65536
--     Defensive (18) = 131072
--     Berserker (19) = 262144
-- Rank 1 shipped as 196608 (Battle | Defensive) and ranks 2-7 as 65536
-- (Battle only).  All seven become 131072.  SpellInfo::CheckShapeshift
-- (SpellInfo.cpp:1444-1497) enforces this from Spell::CheckCast with no
-- script involvement, and the client renders the requirement in the tooltip
-- on its own.
--
-- Ranks now differ only in taunt duration/level, which is deliberate: the
-- damage is the weapon's, so there is nothing left for a rank to scale.
--
-- The base cooldown is untouched (60 sec at rank 1, 120 sec from rank 2).
-- Incite is what moves it -- see woa_2026_08_09_09.sql.
--
-- Spells:
--   694 / 7400 / 7402 / 20559 / 20560 / 25266 / 47504 = Mocking Blow ranks 1-7
-- ============================================================

-- ------------------------------------------------------------
-- Drop core's tauntable-only damage gate
-- ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE FROM `spell_script_names` WHERE `ScriptName` = 'spell_warr_mocking_blow';

